4px;\">\n            树龄：5年（定植大田后，2023第一年投产）\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式：水洗 Washed\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           批次：Hachi Yunnan Project Lot 41\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           风味：\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           洋甘菊、蜂蜜柚子茶、树莓\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Chamomile, Honey Pomelo tea, Raspberry\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           高温是很舒服的清新的洋甘菊花茶香气，然后过渡到柚子茶，然后很厚实的甜，触感也很润；温度下来一些些会有出现一些树莓的果香，有意思呀（有时候还会有些类似萨奇姆的酸角的酸甜风味）；\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 76, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：黄色柑橘+红色莓果核果+绿茶感\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式：蜜处理 Honey\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           批次：Hachi Yunnan Project Lot 40\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           风味： 树莓、玫瑰、红布林、柚子\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Raspberry, Rose, Red plum, Pomelo\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这只很果汁很干净透亮，闻干香气有淡淡的的玫瑰和蜂蜜香，冲出来入口感受更像树莓隐约伴随着蜂蜜和玫瑰香气，酸甜很果汁感，像马甲柚子和红色李子；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：红色莓核果+红色花香+黄色柑橘\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式：蜜处理 Honey\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           批次：云云南南精品咖啡杯测会批次 【雨后天竺葵】\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           风味： 番石榴、释迦果、柚子\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Guava, Sugar apple,  Pomelo\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           这只很果汁很干净透亮，闻干香气有淡淡的的玫瑰和蜂蜜香，冲出来入口感受更像树莓隐约伴随着蜂蜜和玫瑰香气，酸甜很果汁感，像马甲柚子和红色李子；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理简介：\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           高品质全红红果采摘后进行浮选紫外线杀菌，脱去果皮，装入法兰桶密封自然发酵3-4天，开桶加入清水继续低温发酵两周左右，取出晒架遮阴晾干后入库。双重发酵蜜处理的方式提升咖啡的风味层次喝干净度，使咖啡更多的展现其本身品质。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：红色莓核果+红色花香+黄色柑橘\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           处理方式：日晒 Natural\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           批次：Hachi Yunnan Project Lot 35-1\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           风味： 芒果、枇杷、橙子\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Mango, Loquat, Orange\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='line-height: 1.75em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           日晒这只是三只里面最有辨识度最稳定的一只，从最初在产区测到就一直是我心仪的选定的批次，最终有幸买到一点；它就很成熟水果果香，干净，甜美，黄色的果和柑橘；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;color: rgb(255, 41, 65);font-weight: bold;\">\n           特征关键词：黄色热带水果+黄色柑橘+酸甜柔和且饱满\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            关于养豆、储存和冲煮\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" style=\"height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n            关于云顶筑巢\n           </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           // 本文资料源自云云南南与云顶筑巢官方资料\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           云顶筑巢精品咖啡庄园位\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           于云南省临沧双江县沙河乡陈家寨尾帕组，距离\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           双江县城12千米，\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           海拔1450m-1700m。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           2010 年成立至今 ，深耕乌龙茶、 咖啡种植与精深加工产业。历经十余年沉淀发展 ，现已成为集咖啡庄园、有机乌龙茶园、 云顶筑巢茶庄园酒店、 七星池文旅景观于一体的综合性现代农业文旅企业；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b6ibvt0tqrpq9sSNibDZMDEQYwICtKEZ88yFEcTF8gvULicoOX27zewcpVK4rO0mAlbH5XzFKKhxPSfW3mZNTfWgyE8oibLSWVoiclc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b73oUDmicVC4rJQ6TX5Vu5hjHI3HbajNILBxvAgFWp5QMwianTnfziaSnRpbRSAy8qDrPFZuMklkiawc18Jlicib5ZoLhnBJgAg317Lc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           庄园从2019年开始布局同时种植咖啡，\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           从规划、种植到管护均实施标准化管理，全部配置有水肥一体化设施和蓝光诱虫灯等物理防虫设施，台带面上有蓝花楹、肉桂、香樟等护荫树和巴西豆、小饭豆等豆科类覆盖作物。\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           主要种植品种为瑰夏、萨奇姆、铁皮卡、赛琳娜及波旁；2022 年获评云南省十大精品咖啡庄园。2023年新建成年处理2000吨咖啡鲜果的初加工生产线一条，并配套建设晾晒大棚和咖啡精深加工生产线。2024生产季，庄园咖啡开始投产。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b6nvHKvFzyHHzB36j6DV69RxbkicM95SGjTIBiaLCsggJtSVJEvGTTClicEGeibRMPiaxIqTMmpTQzXgx2iaXxjGCqh19iamb0B31RGCo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           关于赛琳娜Syrina品种\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           赛琳娜是一个来自于泰国的品种，是一个带着咖啡人对他所在的社区以及自己家人的爱的品种。克莱布乔丹(Clebb Jordan)是美裔泰国人，他在泰国楠府长大，也是曼尼普尔村第一个推动咖啡咖啡产业的人，他一直思考如何更好的为当地的村民带来更适宜的咖啡品种，由此将巴西咖啡研究机构IAPAR(现IDR-Parana）的IPR107品种进行本地化培育，用自己女儿名字Syrina（赛琳娜)命名培育品种，并且在当地推广种植。IPR107本身培育的目标是抗锈病、高产以及适应热带潮湿气候，他的核心血统来自萨奇姆、蒂姆杂交种、新世界、波旁以及铁皮卡谱系。但在泰国本土的培育过程中却展现出了令人意外的明显的热带水果风味，如今赛琳娜已经成为泰国楠府的标志性咖啡品种。云顶筑巢庄园从2020年引进并种植这个品种，高海拔的种植环境、较大的昼夜温差以及良好的田间管理，赛琳娜又一次给了我们惊喜，拥有更加丰富的风味层测，成为了庄园的代表性品种。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/ruUhEq093b7CW5F2kDpYtf4L6DiaJicqKmZSDFFwQlrX1hkLBaquKDD2GJnAO467eQJeqG5PonuibsDVOUH72HJPJ1ibIJJJQMGfatMKn3YTeZI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;font-weight: bold;\">\n           关于IPR107\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           IPR 107 培育于巴西南部的巴拉那州，其特点是结合了抗咖啡叶锈病和矮小株型的特性，同时继承了其亲本 Iapar 59（巴西巴拉那研究所选育的萨奇姆） 与 Mundo Novo（波旁与铁皮卡的自然杂交，巴西圣保罗） 的广泛适应性和“强健性”。该品种的杂交选育工作于 1982 年在巴拉那农村发展研\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           究所（Instituto de Desenvolvimento Rural do Paraná，IDR-PR，原 IAPAR）启动\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           。2010 年发布时，IPR 107 已表现出对咖啡叶锈病的高度抗性，这一特性在国际多地点品种试验（一个全球咖啡品种测试网络）中得到了进一步验证。在巴西，该品种主要种植于巴拉那州，被推荐用于半密植、密植和超密植种植系统，并适合机械采收。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<font face=\"仿宋\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</font>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 0px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;font-family: mp-quote, \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-style: normal;font-weight: normal;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;height: auto !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
